able the filter.\n\n<span style=\"color:#E69963\">***reverse***</span>\n<br />Flip the filtered weights.\n\n<span style=\"color:#82D99F\">***weight***</span>\n<br />The weight of this filter in the stack.\n\n<span style=\"color:#82D99F\">***steep_threshold***</span>\n<br />The angle above which weights will go to zero.\n\n<span style=\"color:#CCB699\">***adjust_falloff***</span>\n<br />If *spread* is above zero, this will adjust the falloff of the spread.\n\n<span style=\"color:#82D99F\">***spread***</span>\n<br />how much the threshold spreads, higher numbers will make a softer threshold.\n\n\n***\n## Output\n<span style=\"color:#90A3F4\">***steep_filter_data***</span>\n<br />The settings transported into Scatter Plus.","ports":[{"name":"enable","direction":"input","type":"bool","default":"true"},{"name":"steep_threshold","direction":"input","type":"float","default":"30f"},{"name":"adjust_falloff","direction":"input","type":"Math::FCurve","default":{"version":"1","preExtrapolation":"0","postExtrapolation":"0","points":[{"point":{"locked":"1","interpolation":"1","pcn":{"xp":"-0.10000000000000001","yp":"0","x":"0","y":"0","xn":"0.10000000000000001","yn":"0"}}},{"point":{"locked":"1","interpolation":"1","pcn":{"xp":"0.90000000000000002","yp":"1","x":"1","y":"1","xn":"1.1000000000000001","yn":"1"}}}]}},{"name":"weight","direction":"input","type":"float","default":"1f"},{"name":"reverse","direction":"input","type":"bool","default":"false"},{"name":"spread","direction":"input","type":"float","default":"0f"},{"name":"steep_filter_data","direction":"output","type":null}],"terminal_states":[{"name":"Core::Graph::terminal::diagnostic","enabled":"true"}],"counts":{"nodes":8,"connections":14,"values":9,"nested_compounds":1},"node_types":{"Core::Object::set_property":7,"Unknown":1},"custom_dependencies":{},"nodes":[{"path":"root","name":"set_property","type":"Core::Object::set_property"},{"path":"root","name":"set_property1","type":"Core::Object::set_property"},{"path":"root","